Now, slime is all the rage these days.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.400
The kids love it. They're making it in their backyards, in their basements, all by their lonesome.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.940
And I wanted to share with you my very own recipe for slime.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.280
All you'll need are a few simple ingredients you can get in any department store.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.280
You've got Elmer's glue,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.840
