00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.000
Which would be amazing!

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:03.280
Ordinarily, you would use a spoon for this because this is going to be extremely caustic to your hand.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.420
It's uh, these ingredients when they're mixing together,

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.480
